+  - Same phases complete.
+  - Adapter test accuracy within ±3 of 75.0 (temp 0; the traces may differ slightly between runs).
+  - Co-serving SLO ≥ 90 %.
+  - **FAIL if** any script step breaks, or the result deviates beyond noise.
